    "heading": "Level 3: Ranger Subclass",
    "lineStart": 3644,
    "lineEnd": 3646
  },
  "section": "3.203",
  "rulesText": "You gain a Ranger subclass of your choice. The Hunter subclass is detailed after this class's description. A subclass is a specialization that grants you features at certain Ranger levels. For the rest of your career, you gain each of your subclass's features that are of your Ranger level or lower."
}
